1360	  /**
1361	   * A brief callout for what a decision just changed — dead centre, right
1362	   * where the decision card itself was, since that's where the player's
1363	   * eyes already are the instant they click an option. The service log
1364	   * still gets the flavour line; this is the one-line receipt so the
1365	   * consequence doesn't require scrolling to find.
